Subject: [PATCH 04956/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE D5
 (VERIFIER MOAT; the falsifiable GATE + DiffusionGemma-gate resolution) --
 aggregate D1/D2/D3/D4 and DECIDE the off-ARC verifier-moat verdict: does >=1
 oracle-distinct verifier beat TUNED-SC with McNemar CI95 excluding 0 on a
 headroom-present domain? POSITIVE = the moat is realized off ARC + the
 DiffusionGemma gate conditions are satisfied on the tested domain. ALL-NULL
 (LoRA-EBM AND uPRM both fail) = the off-ARC moat retires as bounded (a
 publishable null converging with the ARC tie). retire_if_same_verdict is
 decided HERE.

